\textbf{Real world.} As shown in Figure~\ref{fig:fig6}, LLM-backbone methods outperform RT-1 and Diffusion Policy on seen tasks, with UP-VLA competitive or best. For unseen-object grasping, UP-VLA-RT-2 outperforms UP-VLA-phi-w/o-mmu while UP-VLA is best overall, indicating semantic gains from MMU aligned with actions. On precision tasks, UP-VLA-phi-w/o-mmu outperforms UP-VLA-RT-2 and UP-VLA is best, highlighting the benefit of future prediction for spatial detail.

